e  successfully read bigquery public data  sets and have listed the top Wikipedia  pages in a spark data frame  let's look at the architecture of data  proc serverless or Spark  serverless spark automates the  provisioning and auto scaling of the  infrastructure  users submit sparkcode and can provide  spark properties for any customizations  each spart executor maps to an abstract  unit called Data compute unit  data compute unit represents one  dataproc bcpu plus 4 gigabytes of RAM  billing is only for the duration the job  runs  serverless spark works with both  bigquery and cloud storage  users can attach a persistent history  server to view spark logs after the job  is finished and the hive met store as  well  once the job finishes everything is  cleaned up except the logs and persisted  results  now let's talk about one of our  customers and how dataproc has allowed  them to reduce processing times while  reducing cost  power of data works with big data and  analytics Solutions using technology to  automate and accelerate the entire data  chain process for companies seeking to  significantly improve results  the company handles data storage and  deployment elements in cloud storage and  uses several Google Cloud solutions to  refine its services even further  for instance they use data prompt Bruno  hardim the CTO of power of data told us  that the main benefit came from using  the air problem which helped power of  data reduce processing Times by 94  percent  one of their customers a retailer whose  processing time was 17 hours is now just  30 minutes this is a significant  difference that translates into time and  cost savings  in this session we'll learn more about  Google cloud data proc and how it's  integrated with other open source Tools  in Google Cloud Solutions  in the demo we learn how to use Apache  spark and Jupiter notebooks on cloud  dataproc we also reviewed the dataproc  server list for spark architecture and  we learn how power of data is usi